OL,3,AHome sellers cut asking prices on 3,000
OL,4,Aproperties a day
OL,5,
OL,6,FProperty portals say buyers are now
OL,7,Fhaving to be choosy, with many working
OL,8,Fto a tight budget as mortgage rates
OL,9,Fhave risen to three-year highs.
